            "Panel interview with assigned competency coverage",
            "Job-related work sample or skills exercise",
            "Technical interview using approved prompts and scoring anchors",
            "Final decision interview with documented decision scope",
            "Rescheduled or replacement interview after a process interruption",
            "Accessibility coordination routed without recording medical details"
